{"page":251,"verses":[{"verse_key":"13:14","surah":13,"ayah":14,"ar_uthmani":"لَهُۥ دَعْوَةُ ٱلْحَقِّ ۖ وَٱلَّذِينَ يَدْعُونَ مِن دُونِهِۦ لَا يَسْتَجِيبُونَ لَهُم بِشَىْءٍ إِلَّا كَبَـٰسِطِ كَفَّيْهِ إِلَى ٱلْمَآءِ لِيَبْلُغَ فَاهُ وَمَا هُوَ بِبَـٰلِغِهِۦ ۚ وَمَا دُعَآءُ ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ إِلَّا فِى ضَلَـٰلٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The only true prayer is to Him: those they pray to besides Him give them no answer any more than water reaches the mouth of someone who simply stretches out his hands for it- it cannot do so: the prayers of the disbelievers are all in vain.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَهُۥ","en_gloss":"To Him","transliteration":"lahu","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":2,"ar":"دَعْوَةُ","en_gloss":"(is) supplication","transliteration":"daʿwatu","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْحَقِّ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) the truth","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those whom","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَدْعُونَ","en_gloss":"they invoke","transliteration":"yadʿūna","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"besides Him","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":7,"ar":"دُونِهِۦ","en_gloss":"besides Him","transliteration":"dūnihi","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَسْتَجِيبُونَ","en_gloss":"they respond","transliteration":"yastajībūna","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَهُم","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِشَىْءٍ","en_gloss":"with a thing","transliteration":"bishayin","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":13,"ar":"كَبَـٰسِطِ","en_gloss":"like one who stretches","transliteration":"kabāsiṭi","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كَفَّيْهِ","en_gloss":"his hands","transliteration":"kaffayhi","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":15,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"towards","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلْمَآءِ","en_gloss":"water","transliteration":"l-māi","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":17,"ar":"لِيَبْلُغَ","en_gloss":"to reach","transliteration":"liyablugha","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":18,"ar":"فَاهُ","en_gloss":"his mouth","transliteration":"fāhu","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"but not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":20,"ar":"هُوَ","en_gloss":"it","transliteration":"huwa","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":21,"ar":"بِبَـٰلِغِهِۦ ۚ","en_gloss":"reaches it","transliteration":"bibālighihi","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":22,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":23,"ar":"دُعَآءُ","en_gloss":"(is) the supplication","transliteration":"duʿāu","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":24,"ar":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the disbelievers","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":25,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":26,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":27,"ar":"ضَلَـٰلٍۢ","en_gloss":"error","transliteration":"ḍalālin","verse_key":"13:14"},{"pos":28,"ar":"١٤","en_gloss":"(14)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"13:14"}]},{"verse_key":"13:15","surah":13,"ayah":15,"ar_uthmani":"وَلِلَّهِ يَسْجُدُ مَن فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ طَوْعًا وَكَرْهًا وَظِلَـٰلُهُم بِٱلْغُدُوِّ وَٱلْـَٔاصَالِ ۩","en_translation_id":85,"en":"All that are in heaven and earth submit to God alone, willingly or unwillingly, as do their shadows in the mornings and in the evenings.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"And to Allah","transliteration":"walillahi","verse_key":"13:15"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَسْجُدُ","en_gloss":"prostrates","transliteration":"yasjudu","verse_key":"13:15"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whoever","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"13:15"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(is) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"13:15"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the heavens","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","verse_key":"13:15"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"13:15"},{"pos":7,"ar":"طَوْعًۭا","en_gloss":"willingly","transliteration":"ṭawʿan","verse_key":"13:15"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَكَرْهًۭا","en_gloss":"or unwillingly","transliteration":"wakarhan","verse_key":"13:15"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَظِلَـٰلُهُم","en_gloss":"and (so do) their shadows","transliteration":"waẓilāluhum","verse_key":"13:15"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِٱلْغُدُوِّ","en_gloss":"in the mornings","transliteration":"bil-ghuduwi","verse_key":"13:15"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱلْـَٔاصَالِ ۩","en_gloss":"and in the afternoons","transliteration":"wal-āṣāli","verse_key":"13:15"},{"pos":12,"ar":"١٥","en_gloss":"(15)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"13:15"}]},{"verse_key":"13:16","surah":13,"ayah":16,"ar_uthmani":"قُلْ مَن رَّبُّ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ قُلِ ٱللَّهُ ۚ قُلْ أَفَٱتَّخَذْتُم مِّن دُونِهِۦٓ أَوْلِيَآءَ لَا يَمْلِكُونَ لِأَنفُسِهِمْ نَفْعًا وَلَا ضَرًّا ۚ قُلْ هَلْ يَسْتَوِى ٱلْأَعْمَىٰ وَٱلْبَصِيرُ أَمْ هَلْ تَسْتَوِى ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتُ وَٱلنُّورُ ۗ أَمْ جَعَلُوا۟ لِلَّهِ شُرَكَآءَ خَلَقُوا۟ كَخَلْقِهِۦ فَتَشَـٰبَهَ ٱلْخَلْقُ عَلَيْهِمْ ۚ قُلِ ٱللَّهُ خَـٰلِقُ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ وَهُوَ ٱلْوَٰحِدُ ٱلْقَهَّـٰرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Say [Prophet], ‘Who is Lord of the heavens and the earth?’ Say, ‘God.’ Say, ‘Why do you take protectors other than Him, who can neither benefit nor harm even themselves?’ Say, ‘Are the blind equal to those who can see? And are the depths of darkness equal to the light?’ Have the partners they assign to God created anything like His creation so that their creation is indistinguishable from His? Say, ‘God is the Creator of all things: He is the One, the All Compelling.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"13:16"},{"pos":2,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"Who","transliteration":"man","verse_key